OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is Scotland's housing shortage
OL,4,Agetting worse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is three years since Scotland's
OL,7,Flargest cities declared "housing
OL,8,Femergencies", followed months later by
OL,9,Fthe nation as a whole.
OL,11,FSince then, homelessness has hit record
OL,12,Flevels while the cost of renting or
OL,13,Fbuying property has continued to rise.
OL,15,FThe solution to this crisis would
OL,16,Fappear straightforward - build more
OL,17,Fhouses.
OL,19,FBut delivering this is more
OL,20,Fcomplicated, with responsibility
OL,21,Ffalling to central and local government
OL,22,Fas well as to private housebuilders.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
